v0.0.2
+ Tracert function
+ Credentials window
+ Modyfied -h option (+header witah author, etc.)

v0.0.3
+ Display public IP address by key 'a' 
+ CFG option for displaying public IP: PublicIP ON|OFF

v0.0.4
+ --int INTERFACE to filter displayed interfaces

v0.0.5 
+ --color vga|hgc|mono for display in colors or mono (with Hercules old DOS style :) 

v0.0.6
+ --console option for console view

v0.0.7
+ Fixed public IP acquisition (browser-like User-Agent, longer timeout, additional services)
+ Revised public IP state machine: no fetch on startup when show_public_ip=false;
  toggle with 'A' shows/hides/acquires IP; auto-refresh only while visible
+ Changed public_ip_acquiring default color to yellow,blue
+ Added config options: IPacquisition_fg_color, IPacquisition_bg_color

v0.0.8
+ 'a' key in console view for Public IP displaying
+ Fixed --color option for console view

v0.0.9
+ DNS popup ('d' key) showing DNS servers from /etc/resolv.conf
+ DNS config option in [keys]

v0.0.10
+ Routes popup ('r' key) showing IPv4 and IPv6 routing tables
+ Default route highlighted in configurable color (route_default)
+ Section headers in configurable color (route_header)
+ Config options: route_header, route_default in [colors]; routes in [keys]

FUTURE:
+ Display DNS in console view
